{"title":"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_=\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 =</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the digit in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db43972a31bb85737768e51aa1076120bf5f178c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$623^{rd}$\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> place after the decimal point in the repeating decimal for:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387a5a2b63baa05702f1c04e43386006d0f7cd42.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{9}+\\frac{2}{99}+\\frac{3}{999}.\\]\" width=\"112\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.3D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_=\">Solution 1 =</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 =\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Fist we add them together and divide. We get the repeating decimal .134316134316. We can see that it repeats every six decimal places, so we need to find the remainder when 623 is divided by six. When we divide, we see that the remainder is five, so we go in five decimal places and find 1, and we are done.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/3/0d3dba22edcee4ff7213635505e90128beebb42e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/056c2f990d6a5758c99c078be50de152d8844221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2/99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20bace9895e1a422c3d9286825b8077abffe208a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13/99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" />, and the sum of of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20bace9895e1a422c3d9286825b8077abffe208a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13/99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/2/e8298e1ff321780df38934880887c91835c1dc76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3/999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" /> (aka <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/2/322181b6293daca0a856ab3cb467d1992b937a48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/333$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" />) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/3/1f3662e4dfb1f32c8accbc9546d17519d83a01a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$164/1221$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" />. Doing long division, we get the decimal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/a/9faf389871f26fef3e4b050a714ab2ff31781c28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.\\overline{134316}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" />, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db43972a31bb85737768e51aa1076120bf5f178c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$623^{rd}$\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> place, we only need the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d23cf75833dfa75247f83b85f33714a440b450c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$623\\pod6=5^{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"22\" /> digit, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3547351abf03ab0b6cbda7b0b905b2e4f6220e1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II\">1993 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017152938\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 130/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 94/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2269/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.872      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%   12.872      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13617:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017152938 and revision id 187135. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}